# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification (v1.0.0)
**Author:** Sable Van Dyk  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 00:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Production-ready component token definitions for Atlas Core UI system, aligning SaaS platform interfaces and face-to-face service dashboards. Standardized using guidelines from Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "system": "Atlas Core",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Sable Van Dyk <sable.vandyk@itskokos.internal>",
    "sourceGuidance": "Business Document: Company Document (utilized for SaaS tier branding rules, hybrid service color contrasts, and spacing scales)"
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.600}", "type": "color" },
        "text": { "value": "{color.base.white}", "type": "color" },
        "padding": { "value": "{spacing.md} {spacing.lg}", "type": "spacing" },
        "borderRadius": { "value": "{radius.sm}", "type": "borderRadius" },
        "hover": {
          "background": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.700}", "type": "color" }
        }
      },
      "serviceAction": {
        "background": { "value": "{color.brand.accent.500}", "type": "color", "description": "Dedicated token for in-person service check-in workflows per Company Document standard." },
        "text": { "value": "{color.neutral.900}", "type": "color" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "value": "{color.surface.default}", "type": "color" },
        "border": { "value": "1px solid {color.border.subtle}", "type": "border" },
        "shadow": { "value": "{elevation.sm}", "type": "shadow" },
        "padding": { "value": "{spacing.xl}", "type": "spacing" }
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "base": {
        "height": { "value": "40px", "type": "dimension" },
        "border": { "value": "1px solid {color.border.default}", "type": "border" },
        "focusRing": { "value": "0 0 0 2px {color.brand.primary.200}", "type": "shadow" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```